Package: kaidf
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-yaml, python3-jsonschema, python3-flask, python3-werkzeug, python3-rich, python3-textual, python3-pyperclip
Maintainer: K-AIDF maintainers <https://github.com/kobkob/K-AIDF>
Homepage: https://github.com/kobkob/K-AIDF
Description: K-AIDF terminal agent (kob) and generator
 kob is the terminal agent for K-AIDF repositories. The package bundles the
 kaidf_gen generator and starts from /usr/bin/kob. Project state (.kaidf/) and
 user settings (~/.config/kaidf) are not package files, so upgrades and removal
 keep them.
